{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 83592, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 58392, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "8-10月日历分析", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1627019370, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1628690643, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 12, "status": 1, "summary": "日历解读①赛车妹＆兔女郎翻牌：赛车对PVP环境影响不大，但兔女郎对于低分竞技场的格局影响非常大，低分段玩家可能会出现大量兔女郎，全身套忍耐（岛主的忍耐，大家已经体验过了，兔女郎的特点同样是忍耐），对普", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627023504760_83294777.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022269719_20681167.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022283099_19956632.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 20, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 20631, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 83592, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022283099_19956632.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022283099_19956632.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">日历解读</span></p></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">①</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">赛车妹＆兔女郎翻牌：</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">赛车对PVP环境影响不大，但兔女郎对于低分竞技场的格局影响非常大，低分段玩家可能会出现大量兔女郎，全身套忍耐（岛主的忍耐，大家已经体验过了，兔女郎的特点同样是忍耐），对普通直伤刀的克制比较明显。</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">并且兔女郎在乱斗模式里是EX幻神级角色，没兔女郎基本上别想赢那种程度。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">所以不管是高分排行榜玩家，还是低分玩家，我都推荐加入而不是硬打，多抽几个，对自己的乱斗也有好处，不要和奖励过不去。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">②</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">无限乱斗开放：</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">乱斗是非常消耗资源的活动，要求玩家培养大量的PVP角色，但奖励同样丰厚，具体要等具体的乱斗模式奖励揭晓了，再给予评价。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（乱斗奖励的多少直接决定我们应不应该大量投资PVP）</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">③卡拉拉特利火Raid:</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">鉴于国际服青钢影太过强势，策划可能会对BOSS技能进行魔改，首先魅惑和时间篡改是必备的，目的是让青钢影挂不上加速，打不出固伤，然后当期对策水罗刹，又是一位泛用性极差的角色，但鉴于国际服的雷欧魔改出了护盾技能，而且水罗刹本身具有最大HP增加技能，和雷欧的定位重复，我们不需要这种过量的保护＆生存技能，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">所以水罗刹魔改可能性非常高。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">卡拉拉特利作为天子时的技能组太过华丽，减益延长+魅惑，而且又是火属性可以吃火人鱼加速，完美适配WB环境，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">只要技能不改，绝对是WB的常驻角色</span>，替换掉鲸鱼＆木糖猫，高配玩家可尝试下掉卢茵。但国际服策划喜欢削BOSS强度，具体还得看实装。</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">④哈皮翻牌：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\">哈皮是本来应该去年11月就实装的角色，现在PVP怪物一个个全都出了，哈皮再放出来已经没什么用了，增益吸收+烙印，和木糖猫严重冲突，上场机会应该不大。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">但策划此时决定补一位旧角色，令人深思，不排除当期翻牌空降其他角色的可能性。</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">根据我多年画饼的经验，结合官方的大饼，我得到了结论：哈皮翻牌时期，高达90%的概率会开放赛季版无限乱斗模式，并且蒙眼在这期活动实装的可能性极高，达到70%，请各位做好准备。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">⑤关于丽莎作业＆蒙眼：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">国际服应该是有的，但目前还未确定开放时间，只能慢慢等了。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">（达比头没有足够的权限知道策划的具体安排，现在只能告诉我们不清楚，说不定策划已经决定周四出蒙眼了，只不过没告诉达比头罢了！一切等下周三公告）</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627023300435_67836388.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627023300435_67836388.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">新天子评价</span></p></div><br></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022269719_20681167.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022269719_20681167.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">后续活动预测</span></p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627023504760_83294777.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627023504760_83294777.png\"></div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627023504760_83294777.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022269719_20681167.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627022283099_19956632.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_b